    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43800" root="&#xA;                        ناى&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُؤْىٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A trench dug round a tent,</i> (S, K,) or <i>a
barrier</i> [<i>raised</i>] <i>around it,</i> (T, IB, TA,) <i>to
prevent the rain-water from entering it,</i> (S,) or
<i>keep off a torrent.</i> (K.)

